          "cultural_impact": "Billie Eilish has had a significant impact on popular culture, influencing fashion trends with her oversized clothing style, redefining pop music with her unique sound and production, and opening conversations about mental health and youth issues. She has become a voice for Generation Z and a symbol of authenticity and individuality in the music industry.",
